        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          We tested 10+ driveway and concrete cleaners against real oil stains, rust spots, tire marks, and mildew on both asphalt and concrete. Zep, Krud Kutter, Oil Eater, Simple Green — only 7 made the cut. Here's what actually gets your driveway clean and ready for sealer.
